WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
fifty-nine seconds

2
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:04,130
We were injured to save you

3
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:06,130
Why are you still refusing to save me?

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Let me beg you

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,000
None of us will enter you

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Just save my captain

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,000
what do you want

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,000
I'll do it all for you

9
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:25,600
please

10
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,600
rescue captain

11
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:40,720
Xu Shaoyang

12
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,580
It's really you

13
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,710
I stayed with me until death in my previous life

14
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:46,710
It's him

15
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:48,380
you know me
